Reading:
- Presets 1 and -1 diverge in the KEY frame of a video encode (36/36 and
  32/36), although the same presets are byte-identical as stills
  (identity_full_8bit): a video-arm intra configuration difference.
  Preset 7 has 8 key-frame cells; 10..13 have 2.
- Presets 0, 2, 3 diverge early in inter frames (29..31 of 36).
- Presets 6, 8, 9 are nearly clean (32..34 of 36). Presets 11, 12 and 13
  give identical per-cell verdicts (why was not checked).
